{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","翠绿之槛"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","翠緑の檻"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤寄生草地，范围内的敌人无法移动并被吸收生命值和损失能量，期间达赫妮婆婆免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","寄生の芝生を召喚して範囲内の敵を行動不能にし、HPを吸収して、SPを減少させる。発動中、行動阻害無効になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自身周围2格范围内召唤寄生草地，持续3秒，寄生草地范围内的敌军无法行动，每秒失去25 + 5点能量。范围内的所有敌军每秒还会失去总计130% ATK的生命值，并且每个敌军至少失去60% ATK生命值，达赫妮婆婆自身会回复等量的生命值。技能持续期间达赫妮婆婆处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","3秒間、自身を中心に半径2マス範囲の寄生の芝生を召喚。寄生の芝生範囲内にいる敵は行動不能になり、毎秒25 + 5のSPを失う。さらに、範囲内にいる敵全体は毎秒、合計130% ATK分のHPを失い、それぞれの敵は最低で60% ATKのHPを失う。ダウナエは敵が失ったHPと同量のHPを回復。スキルの持続期間中、ダウナエはスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":52,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":90,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":131,"end":133,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":82,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":108,"end":115,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":159,"end":167,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至140% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至65% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の敵全体が毎秒失うHPの合計値が140% ATKにUPし、それぞれの敵が失うHPの最低値が65% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","范围内敌军每秒失去的能量提升至35 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の敵が毎秒失うSPが35 + 5にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至150% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至70% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の敵全体が毎秒失うHPの合計値が150% ATKにUPし、それぞれの敵が失うHPの最低値が70% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","范围内所有敌军每秒总计失去的生命值提升至160% ATK，并且每个敌人至少失去的生命值提升至75% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の敵全体が毎秒失うHPの合計値が160% ATKにUPし、それぞれの敵が失うHPの最低値が75% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","种子炮弹"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","シードミサイル"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌人持续对达赫妮婆婆造成伤害时，向其发射寄生种子降低其急速。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵からダメージを複数回受けた時、寄生シードを発射し、対象の速度をDOWNさせる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","任一敌人累计对达赫妮婆婆造成最大生命值15%的伤害后，达赫妮婆婆会使用盾牌对其发射寄生种子，造成120% + 15% ATK伤害，降低其40点急速，持续6秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体から受けたダメージがHP上限×15%に達するたびに、その対象に寄生シードを発射し、120% + 15% ATKのダメージを与え、6秒間、対象の速度-40"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至50点。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","速度減少量が50にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至55点。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","速度減少量が55にUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低急速提升至60点。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","速度減少量が60にUP"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","愤怒之讽"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","激怒の挑発"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","嘲讽一个敌军，同时恢复生命值。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体に挑発を付与、自身のHPを回復"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","嘲讽一个敌军，持续3秒，同时立刻恢复140% + 15% ATK生命值。该技能会优先对正在攻击最虚弱的友军的敌人使用。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵1体に3秒間の挑発を付与し、HPを140% + 15% ATK回復。最も弱っている味方を攻撃している敵に優先的に発動"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","HP回復量が150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","HP回復量が160% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","HP回復量が170% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身受愈，释放“翠绿之槛”期间进一步提升受愈。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の治癒UP。「翠緑の檻」の発動中、追加で自身の治癒UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高11点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升3点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+11。「翠緑の檻」の発動中、追加で自身の治癒+3"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升4点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+15。「翠緑の檻」の発動中、追加で自身の治癒+4"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高19点受愈。且当释放“翠绿之槛”期间，额外提升5点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の治癒+19。「翠緑の檻」の発動中、追加で自身の治癒+5"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","花王祝祷"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","花王の祝祷"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","生命值低时，大幅提升自身护甲和魔抗，并持续恢复生命值。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","HPが低い時、自身の物理・魔法防御が大幅UP、継続的にHPを回復。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生命值低于50%时，荧荧花盾牌快速成长，自身护甲提升50%，魔抗提升50%，且每秒恢复100% ATK生命值，持续12秒，每场战斗最多使用一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","HPが50%より低い場合、蛍光花の盾が急速に成長し、12秒間、自身の物理防御+50%、魔法防御+50%、毎秒100% ATKのHPを回復。この効果は1度の戦闘につき、1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":43,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":54,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","持续期间每秒恢复生命值提升至105% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","持続期間中、毎秒回復するHPが105% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","持续期间自身处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","持続期間中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","持续期间每秒恢复生命值提升至110% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","持続期間中、毎秒回復するHPが110% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“种子炮弹”发射种子立即恢复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","スキル「シードミサイル」でシードを発射する時に、直ちにHPを回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“种子炮弹”发射种子时立刻恢复120% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","スキル「シードミサイル」でシードを発射する時に、直ちにHPを120% ATK分回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","释放“种子炮弹”时，立即回复100点能量，在技能动作期间自身急速提高150点，且敌人受到该技能发射的寄生种子影响时额外降低70%的攻击力。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","スキル「シードミサイル」発動時、直ちにSPを100回復。スキルモーションの期間中、自身の速度+150。このスキルで発射されたシードの影響を受けた敵は、さらに攻撃力-70%"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","荧荧花的友谊"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","蛍光花の友情"]]}